From 525b9fc7e0b47ad7608c20be1e418501f9e8f779 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JustFoura <JustFoura.dev@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:25:52 +1300
Subject: [PATCH 01/18] qwen4exp engineering: MoE cache path for verify widths
 (n_tokens<=4, LLAMA_MOE_CACHE_MAX_TOKENS), draft-mtp mem-shared arch guard,
 inserts=0 fix, readahead overshoot fix
 (LLAMA_MOE_MADV_RANDOM/LLAMA_MOE_PREAD), GGML_MOE_CHAIN_LOG accounting

Measured 2026-09-28: decode 1.50 t/s standard bench (0.94 prior), pure-decode
io 0.90 -> 0.16 GiB/tok; prefill one-pass 87.1 t/s at ubatch 16384 on 8.5k
prompt. Details in Llama-Studio docs/bench-results-2026-09-28/FINDINGS.md.
